# The page-side EIP-1193 provider, read from the web tree.
#
# ONE provider script for four clients. The extension ships these bytes, the
# desktop injects them, Android syncs them into its assets, and this copies
# them into the app bundle. A second hand-written provider would be a second
# set of answers to questions about somebody's money.
$(SRCROOT)/../../app-web/vela-wallet/extension/lib/protocol.js
$(SRCROOT)/../../app-web/vela-wallet/extension/inpage.js
